  "gaps": "Critic fixes applied (pilotis colonnade, bar rails, steel gallery columns, planters, tan paving, taller palms, steeper dark timber hall) but the blocks still read as stucco houses with glazed ground floors; the hall is a plain hipped box, not a lattice; palms are low-poly and not crowding the frame; paving has no concentric pattern; camera is a distant overview, not the street-level photo viewpoint."
